Description: neutralize a cell opening with a double quote in the decision log
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: no

A cell whose first character is a double quote is parsed as a quoted TSV
field by spreadsheet and TSV readers, which corrupts every column after it.
The existing guard covers spreadsheet formula characters but not this one.

--- a/pstack/skills/show-me-your-work/scripts/log.sh
+++ b/pstack/skills/show-me-your-work/scripts/log.sh
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
 	local v
 	v=$(printf '%s' "$1" | tr '\t\n\r' '   ')
 	case "$v" in
-		=*|+*|-*|@*) printf "'%s" "$v" ;;
+		=*|+*|-*|@*|\"*) printf "'%s" "$v" ;;
 		*) printf '%s' "$v" ;;
 	esac
 }
